### Evolution is a powerful, creative algorithm

@(0.53,0.55) {w=0.58, anchor=center} ![Tree of life](assets/tree-of-life.jpg)
@(0.07,0.38) {size=23px, color=#55E6C1, w=0.17} One process. Uncountable forms, strategies, and behaviors.

% SPEAKER: Stress the generative power of biology. Evolution does not merely tune one solution; it continually discovers different ways of being viable.
% SOURCE: Tree-of-life collage from the user-provided 2026 ALife.pptx.

---
# The question is not whether complexity can evolve
## It is: what makes complex, interesting outcomes likely?

@(0.50,0.72) {size=24px, color=#FFB36A, anchor=center} The environment is part of the algorithm.

% SPEAKER: This is the thesis. Selection can only work with the pathways, interactions, and units of individuality that the environment makes available.

!---
@(0.50,0.50) {w=0.75, anchor=center} ![Evolution is hard to study](assets/optional-evolution-hard-1.png)
@(0.05,0.05) {size=16px, color=#FFCB6B} OPTIONAL DETAIL · WHY DIGITAL EVOLUTION?

