@(0.08,0.13) {size=21px, color=#55E6C1} DESIGN LEVER 1
@(0.08,0.25) {size=58px, color=#F4F1E8, w=0.80} Supply stepping stones—without prescribing the path
@(0.08,0.56) {size=28px, color=#9FB0C5, w=0.76} Complex traits are easier to discover when simpler functions can accumulate as reusable building blocks.

% SPEAKER: This is the first and most foundational result. Keep the language tied to virtual-creature design: reward useful capabilities that can be recombined.

