### Optional lineage detail: where functions live in the genome

@(0.50,0.49) {w=0.68, anchor=center} ![Genome task map](assets/genome-task-map.png)
@(0.50,0.85) {size=21px, color=#9FB0C5, anchor=center} Mutations can affect several functions at once—building blocks are reused and entangled.

% SPEAKER: Optional: this is why gain and loss often coincide. A single instruction participates in multiple computations.
% SOURCE: Genome analysis from the user-provided 2026 ALife.pptx.

