### Group reproduction reorganized the world

@(0.10,0.25) {w=0.31} ![Single-celled digital organisms](assets/single-cell-organisms.png)
@(0.59,0.25) {w=0.31} ![Multicellular digital organisms](assets/multicellular-organisms.png)

@(0.26,0.20) {size=22px, color=#9FB0C5, anchor=center} independent cells
@(0.74,0.20) {size=22px, color=#55E6C1, anchor=center} heritable collectives

@(0.50,0.89) {size=22px, color=#F4F1E8, anchor=center} New individuality enables coordination, development, and division of labor.

